## 14. Azure Monitor for Containers

### Overview

**Container Insights** monitors the performance of container workloads deployed to:
- **Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)**
- **Azure Container Instances (ACI)**
- **Arc-enabled Kubernetes**

### Metrics Collected

| Level | Metrics |
|---|---|
| **Node** | CPU %, Memory %, Disk usage |
| **Pod** | CPU requests vs limits |
| **Container** | Memory working set, Restarts |
| **Cluster** | Overall health and capacity |

### Enabling Container Insights for AKS

```bash
# Enable via Azure CLI
az aks enable-addons \
  --resource-group MyResourceGroup \
  --name MyAKSCluster \
  --addons monitoring \
  --workspace-resource-id /subscriptions/{id}/resourceGroups/{rg}/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/{workspace}
```

### Useful KQL for Containers

```kql
// Pod restarts in last 24 hours
KubePodInventory
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where PodRestartCount > 0
| summarize Restarts = max(PodRestartCount) by PodName, Namespace
| order by Restarts desc
```

