## 17. Cost Management in Azure Monitor

### What Generates Costs

| Service | Cost Driver |
|---|---|
| Log Analytics | Data ingestion (GB/month) + retention beyond 31 days |
| Application Insights | Data ingestion (5 GB/month free) |
| Alerts | Number of alert rules and notifications |
| Metrics (custom) | Per metric series, per minute |

### Cost Optimization Tips

1. **Filter what you collect** – Only enable relevant diagnostic categories
2. **Set data caps** – Log Analytics → Usage and estimated costs → Daily cap
3. **Use Basic Logs tier** – For high-volume, low-query data (cheaper)
4. **Archive old logs** – Move to Storage Account after 31 days
5. **Sampling in App Insights** – Reduce telemetry volume automatically
6. **Deduplicate workspaces** – Use one workspace per region/environment

### Estimating Costs

Use the **Azure Pricing Calculator:**
- Go to: `https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/calculator/`
- Search: "Log Analytics"
- Enter estimated GB/day ingestion
- Choose retention period

